Maintainer: LiaoYiHui <yhliao@webmail.hzau.edu.cn>
Description: Modular package for pig feeding station data standardization,
    quality control and phenotype calculation. The current development
    baseline supports YANGXIANG, Nedap and FIRE data sources, birth info
    mapping, structured QC outputs, regression diagnostics and build-first
    package validation. Only the national_standard QC method is supported
    since V1.0.0 (legacy method removed).
